{"id":"n69741-1-7","stage":5,"title":"유골 · 遗骨","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69741-1-7-1","ko":"유적을 발굴하다가 유골들을 발견했다면서요?","zh":"听说在挖掘遗址时发现了遗骨对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유적을","meaning":"遗迹","explanation":"유적：遗迹；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유적","audio":"/audio/f0ecf347817b004bfd2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27111","senseId":"1","lemma":"유적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유적을","audio":"/audio/01de85f66de1ca56cf85.mp3"}},{"text":"발굴하다가","meaning":"发掘 ，挖掘","explanation":"발굴하다：发掘 ，挖掘；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"발굴하다","audio":"/audio/d09cd4ed516fdb10d976.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56583","senseId":"1","lemma":"발굴하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발굴하다가","audio":"/audio/e2ec1d19e07f580c70d0.mp3"}},{"text":"유골들을","meaning":"遗骨，尸骨","explanation":"유골：遗骨，尸骨；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유골","audio":"/audio/bf842c9af71fcfb2cdfd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69741","senseId":"1","lemma":"유골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유골들을","audio":"/audio/54d1c265daeffa6494a1.mp3"}},{"text":"발견했다면서요?","meaning":"发现","explanation":"발견하다：发现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”","readings":[{"term":"발견하다","audio":"/audio/78e36b4554d81e326830.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57303","senseId":"1","lemma":"발견하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발견했다면서요","audio":"/audio/430739461d0d2c8767ed.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f0ecf347817b004b","term":"유적","zh":"遗迹","audio":"/audio/f0ecf347817b004bfd2c.mp3","entryId":"27111","definition":"保留下来的历史痕迹。","pronunciation":["유적"]},{"id":"d09cd4ed516fdb10","term":"발굴하다","zh":"发掘 ，挖掘","audio":"/audio/d09cd4ed516fdb10d976.mp3","entryId":"56583","definition":"把埋藏在地下、土堆或石堆里的东西找到并挖出来。","pronunciation":["발굴하다"]},{"id":"bf842c9af71fcfb2","term":"유골","zh":"遗骨，尸骨","audio":"/audio/bf842c9af71fcfb2cdfd.mp3","en